  "summary": "The experiment tested an RNA-only model using PCA_n2000 encoder with singleprofile setting, achieving validation accuracy of 0.4849 and F1 score of 0.4639. These results establish an initial baseline for unimodal RNA-based approaches in this task. The performance suggests potential room for improvement, but uncertainties remain about the impact of multimodal integration or alternative encoding strategies."
}

